# The `hep-title` package

Extended title data: subtitles, series, preprints, affiliations,
ORCID, keywords and abstracts

## Introduction

The `hep-title` package extends the title macros of the standard classes
with series and subtitle metadata, preprint and reprint blocks, DOI and
arXiv helpers, author, editor, endorser, affiliation, email and ORCID
helpers, date and abstract formatting, keywords, and two-column
title-aware abstracts.

To use the `hep-title` package include it with `\usepackage{hep-title}`.

